                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                 Configuration                                  
                                                                                
                  punchout can be configured via a TOML file:                   
                                                                                
                   /home/user/.config/punchout/punchout.toml                    
                                                                                
                     Sample configuration can be found at:                      
                                                                                
             https://github.com/dhth/punchout#using-a-config-file.              
                                                                                
              You can print the config that punchout will use via:              
                                                                                
                            $ punchout --list-config                            
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
 punchout   5 / 6    h/← previous   space/l/→ next   esc/q quit                 